<surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name><name><surname>Perera</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Atapattu</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheriff</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Warrel</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute yellow oleander poisoning; cardiac arrhythmias, electrolyte disturbances, and serum cardiac glycoside concentrations on presentation to hospitals</article-title><source>Heart</source><year>2000</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>301</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10677410</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/heart.83.3.301</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Premaratna</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Saparamadu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Samarasekera</surname><given-names>DN</given-names></name><name><surname>Warren</surname><given-names>BF</given-names></name><name><surname>Jewell</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>de Silva</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Eosinophilic granulomatous vasculitis mimicking a gastric neoplasm</article-title><source>Histopathology</source><year>1999</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>479</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10583568</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-2559.1999.035005479.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sumathipala</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hewege</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanwella</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Mann</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Randomised controlled tr